    "statement": "For the frozen artifact denominator enumerated by this audit, every retained completed MTC presentation comparison satisfies its recorded tolerance, coordinate map, witness rule, or independently calibrated presentation normalization. No retained artifact is a certified counterexample to the conditional marked stable no-go proposition. On the sole current exotic target, Figure 21, the strongest result is only distribution-level compatibility: all 15 pointed rows match after ordinary-aggregate presentation normalization, two semion rows use the independently derived correction -1, and no H2-marked pointwise comparison is certified.",
    "statement_zh_tw": "在本 audit 明列並凍結的既有計算範圍內，所有保留的完整 MTC presentation comparisons 都通過各自記錄的誤差、座標搬運、witness 或獨立校準的 presentation normalization；沒有任何一份保留資料構成上述條件式 no-go 命題的已認證反例。唯一真正的 exotic target Figure 21 目前只能說：15 個 pointed rows 經 ordinary Kirby-color aggregate 獨立校準後 distribution 全部相同；其中 2 個 semion rows 的校準因子為 -1，而且尚無 H2-marked pointwise comparison。",
    "status": "ESTABLISHED_MACHINE_CHECKED_STATEMENT_ABOUT_RETAINED_ARTIFACTS",
